  "description": "When the trail gets rough, you'll roll with ease. The Flightline Two 26\" Plus offers innovative 26\" Plus wheels and WTB 2.8\" tires at a great-value price point. Choose Plus for increased confidence, traction and braking efficiency thanks to a wider tire contact surface, as well as shock absorption and long-ride comfort. You won't sacrifice the terrain-conquering ability of a 24-speed drive train; our chainstays are engineered with extra clearance for Plus-size tires.\nNew MY17 Haro FL3G 6000 series alloy frame, w/ internal head tube & disc mount dropouts\nSuntour XCT HLO 27.5\" fork w/ 100mm travel, Post mount, hydraulic lockout\nSuntour XCC 42/34/24 alloy crankset\nSuntour sealed cartridge BB 122x50mm chainline\nNew Shimano TY-700 front derailleur\nShimano Altus RD-M310-L rear derailleur\nShimano ST-EF510 3x8-speed shifters\nShimano 8-speed 12-32t cassette\nPivit alloy 25mm riser bar 31.8mm & stem\nWeinmann U-32 alloy double wall rims\nPivit alloy cassette 32h hubs\nNew WTB Ranger 26x2.8\" tires\nTektro Aries MD-M280 disc brakes\nFPD Platform Pedals w/ Nylon body",
